  "level": 3,
  "html": "<p>When IT issues an item to you, you get an email from the IT helpdesk titled <strong>&quot;… has been issued to you&quot;</strong>. Check the item, then press <strong>Confirm receipt</strong> in the email. ITrack asks for your <strong>ID number</strong> as a signature, then records that you received it.</p><p>The link works once and expires after 7 days. Opening it does nothing on its own; only pressing the button records anything.</p>",
